  "notes": [
    "Regular reflexive -AR verb, no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *tumbado* (regular)",
    "The non-reflexive *tumbar* means to knock down or topple; *tumbarse* specifically means to lie down or stretch out",
    "Common usage: *tumbarse en el sofá* (to lie down on the sofa), *tumbarse al sol* (to lie in the sun), *tumbarse a dormir* (to lie down to sleep)",
    "Related: *estar tumbado/a* (to be lying down — state), *tumbar* (to knock over/topple)"
